<title>GERMANY: German Ifo poll - Forecasts for February Ifo.</title>
<headline>German Ifo poll - Forecasts for February Ifo.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of a poll of 11 economists on Germany's closely watched Ifo business climate index for February. In January, the Ifo index was 93.3 for west Germany. The index is expected to be released this week. What is your forecast for February Ifo?</p>
<p>Economist</p>
<p> Olaf Liedke, Helaba Frankfurt	 93.5</p>
<p> Elanie Heldmann, BfG Bank	     93.5</p>
<p> Volker Nitsch, Bankges. Berlin	93.8</p>
<p> Joerg Henzler, JP Morgan, Frankfurt 93.5</p>
<p> Ulrich Jochheim, DG Bank, Frankfurt n/a</p>
<p> Petra Koehler, Dresdner Bank	  n/a</p>
<p> Adolf Rosenstock, IBJ Frankfurt     96.0</p>
<p> Nobuaki Hori, Daiwa Europe, Frankf. 97.0</p>
<p> Alison Cottrell, Paine Webber, Lon. n/a</p>
<p>--Harald Nick, Frankfurt newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
